6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"陶代尼 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"1906年，采盐的位置位于城区以南3公里处，二十世纪五十年代时距离城区5公里，而今天距离城区9公里。\n陶代尼几乎位于世界上最热的地方--撒哈拉沙漠的中心、的南部，离最近的有人居住地达到数百英里。\n 这里也是世界上最干旱的地方之一，降水主要集中在七月到十月之间。","culture":"当时，陶代尼唯一的建筑物是一座名为斯米达堡（Ksar de Smida）的克萨。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q1888993","articleTitle":"陶代尼","sourceRevision":92883107,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 陶代尼","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%B6%E4%BB%A3%E5%B0%BC"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92883107"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1888993"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159148541","name":"阿拉萬","country":"MLI","lat":18.90002,"lon":-3.52995,"kind":"city","region":"ML-6","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159148543","name":"泰薩利","country":"MLI","lat":20.20139,"lon":1.08881,"kind":"city","region":"ML-8","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159148545","name":"梅納卡","country":"MLI","lat":15.91666,"lon":2.4,"kind":"city","region":"ML-7","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159148585","name":"納拉","country":"MLI","lat":15.18001,"lon":-7.27998,"kind":"city","region":"ML-BKO","rank":6,"capital":0},{"id":"city-1159148587","name":"库利科罗","country":"MLI","lat":12.88331,"lon":-7.54999,"kind":"city","region":"ML-BKO","rank":6,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"库利科罗 · 地点概要","geo":"库利科罗（Koulikoro）是马利的城市，为库利科罗区的首府，于尼日河河畔，距首都巴马科59公里。\n于8月及11月间，雨季结束后，可由尼日河与塞古、莫普提、廷巴克图及加奥等地通航。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q740974","articleTitle":"庫利科羅","sourceRevision":94807991,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 ·